          "text": "The user wants an eta scan with 5 steps of cos theta* from -1 to +1 at W=1.7, Q2=1.5, phi*=90. Need to check preflight, use the correct channel (eta), generate inputs. Let's first list channels to confirm eta and defaults, then preflight check.",
